# Simple ChatGPT Integration Project Overview

This is a full-stack web application that demonstrates how to integrate ChatGPT API with a modern web interface. The project consists of a frontend (HTML/CSS/JavaScript) and a backend (FastAPI/Python).

## Project Structure

### Frontend Files
- [index.html](mdc:index.html) - Main HTML interface with form and response display
- [css/styles.css](mdc:css/styles.css) - Modern responsive styling with gradient design
- [js/api.js](mdc:js/api.js) - JavaScript application handling API calls and UI updates

### Backend Files
- [backend/main.py](mdc:backend/main.py) - FastAPI server with ChatGPT integration
- [main.py](mdc:main.py) - Entry point for uvicorn server

### Configuration Files
- [package.json](mdc:package.json) - Project scripts and metadata
- [.evn.example](mdc:.evn.example) - Environment variables template
- [readme.md](mdc:readme.md) - Comprehensive tutorial and documentation

## Key Features
- **Real-time ChatGPT Integration**: Send text to OpenAI's API and display responses
- **Modern UI**: Clean, responsive design with loading states and error handling
- **CORS Configuration**: Properly configured for local development
- **Example Questions**: Pre-built examples to test the interface
- **Error Handling**: Graceful error display and user feedback

## Technology Stack
- **Frontend**: HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla JavaScript
- **Backend**: FastAPI, Python 3.10+, OpenAI API
- **Development**: Uvicorn server, Python HTTP server
- **Styling**: Modern CSS with gradients, animations, and responsive design

## Development Commands
- `pnpm run-backend` - Start FastAPI server on localhost:8000
- `pnpm run-website` - Start frontend server on localhost:3000
- `pnpm setup` - Install Python dependencies

## API Endpoints
- `GET /` - Health check endpoint
- `POST /api/chat` - Send text to ChatGPT and receive response

The application demonstrates a complete full-stack integration with modern web technologies and AI services.
